  "description": "Outlander.Blazor is a modern and lightweight component library for Blazor applications. Built with enterprise scenarios in mind, it provides high-performance UI components including advanced data grids, filtering, searching, sorting, exporting, and reusable controls designed to accelerate business application development.",
