  "releaseNotes": "Added new layout and theming components.\n\t\t1. NavMenu\n\t\t2. Layout\n\t\t3. TopMenu\n\t\t4. ThemeSelector\n\t\tImproved OutlanderNavMenu with automatic active route detection and automatic parent expansion.\n\t\tImproved Bootstrap tooltip lifecycle handling for Blazor SPA navigation.\n\t\tExpanded component demos and documentation.",
